+/*
+ * Clear the PSM thread reference before publishing STATE_ZOMBIE.
+ *
+ * fd_peer_remove() may free the peer immediately after observing
+ * STATE_ZOMBIE, so the PSM must not access the peer object after
+ * that state becomes visible.
